    {
      "source": "Define the minItems and maxItems via the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Range.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a>.<br/>\nIn-/Exclusions via <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Range.Bound.html#isInclusive()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>range bounds</code></a> are not taken into account.",
      "translation": "通过给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Range.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Range</code></a> 定义 minItems 和 maxItems。<br/>\n不考虑通过 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-data/commons/docs/current/api/org/springframework/data/domain/Range.Bound.html#isInclusive()\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>range bounds</code></a> 进行的包含/排除。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Convenience <a href=\"../JsonSchemaProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mongodb.core.schema\"><code>JsonSchemaProperty</code></a> implementation for a <code>type : 'array'</code> property.",
